# Binary fixtures must not be touched by line-ending normalization.
# CI windows-latest runner previously failed with
# `lopdf load error: couldn't parse input: invalid file trailer`
# because GitHub's checkout@v4 normalized line endings on the runner,
# corrupting the PDF trailer (PDFs are byte-sensitive: trailer dictionary,
# startxref offset, and %%EOF marker must match exactly).
#
# Marking the file `binary` tells git to copy it as-is on every platform.
tests/fixtures/sample.pdf binary
